Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.05,0:01:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,250)\blur7.5\be5\1c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\fn@更紗黑體 TC\frz270\pos(1456.5,496.5)}遠山高仰止
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.05,0:01:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,250)\blur7.5\be5\1c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&\fn@更紗黑體 TC\frz270\pos(1360.5,625.5)}峰頂染櫻紅
